    "text": "1 days ago 📅 Highlights from Lynchburg City Schools – Sept. 24, 2026\nLynchburg City Schools shared a round‑up of recent student achievements and upcoming events.\nRecent stories include:\nA new basketball program supporting special education students . A student fashion designer earning a national award . Students helping celebrate the Air Force’s 79th birthday with a cake‑cutting. A middle school student training like a NASA astronaut . Liberty football players reading to younger students. The Heritage High Pioneers winning the Jug Bowl . Coming up:\nLynchburg Classic – Oct. 3 Medford League basketball game at ECG Fall Double Feature: Badger & Euridyce at ECG Families and students who are interested can mark their calendars for the events that appeal to them.\nMore Info: Lately at LCS - September 24, 2026 | LCS | Lynchbu...\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
